# Vietnamese Model failure

The VTB corpus (1,400 sentences, 1,791 vocabulary, 37 XPOS, 80 DEPREL) exhibited severe overfitting.

For example, validation XPOS: 40%, train: 88%, highlighted the importance of simplified annotation schemes for corpora <3K sentences. 

This result informs bezoku's emerging annotation guidelines for newly created treebanks with annotation schema with 
≤20 XPOS, ≤40 DEPREL, targeting 5K+ vocabulary.
